{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-2-1","kind":"proposition","title":"乘法分配律的几何表达","englishTitle":"If there be two straight lines, and one of them be cut into any number of segments whatever, the rectangle contained by the two straight lines is equal to the rectangles contained by the uncut straight line and each of the segments.","book":2,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","contentId":"euclid-2-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cbc372bed89dc1eab51f4db4251db9a50821dd33a488cdd439e9d77e2ec90a63","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-2-1.statement","euclid-2-1.construction.1","euclid-2-1.construction.2","euclid-2-1.proof.1","euclid-2-1.proof.2","euclid-2-1.proof.3","euclid-2-1.proof.4","euclid-2-1.proof.5","euclid-2-1.conclusion","euclid-2-1.historical.1","euclid-2-1.historical.2","euclid-2-1.historical.3","euclid-2-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-2-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"576467577297805ead2eddf54e313ba635327b80b011b817f761dc5fe949ec86","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be two straight lines, and one of them be cut into any number of segments whatever, the rectangle contained by the two straight lines is equal to the rectangles contained by the uncut straight line and each of the segments."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有两条直线,其中一条被切成任何几个区段,那么,由两条直线组成的矩形等于由未剪断的直线和每个区段组成的矩形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线任以一线任分为若干分其两元线矩内直角形与不分线偕诸分线矩内诸直角形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何由一条直线取出的两条直线都被划分为若干部分：两条直线的矩形和未分割的线段之和等于所有分支的矩形之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f4124f238a4492da52f9f630a978d4346cce574d31b23d0132324a31b296a71","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, BC be two straight lines, and let BC be cut at random at the points D, E; I say that the rectangle contained by A, BC is equal to the rectangle contained by A, BD, that contained by A, DE and that contained by A, EC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,BC成为两条直线,让BC在D,E点随机切开;我说,A,BC形成的矩形等于A,BD形成的矩形,A由DE组成,A,EC组成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"190d5472e4359e3d06175c92320bd6d5dd27acfbdc49741374b39b6d213a92af","citations":["euclid-1-11","euclid-1-3","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BF be drawn from B at right angles to BC; [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)] let BG be made equal to A, [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] through G let GH be drawn parallel to BC, [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)] and through D, E, C let DK, EL, CH be drawn parallel to BG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BF从直角的B抽取至BC;BG等于A,G等于GH等于BC;D等于E,C等于DK,EL等于CH。 [[I. 11](/principles/euclid-1-11)] [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14742de885c74076d5a312df77eb73188d9325c72bd0a6036c73265f288162a5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then BH is equal to BK, DL, EH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BH等于BK,DL,EH"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8bfe46c68b6a0c4966047ff03cac0e16eb9ea4692adb6e3759fb638296f803c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now BH is the rectangle A, BC, for it is contained by GB, BC, and BG is equal to A;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BH是矩形 A,BC, GB由GB,BC组成,BG等于A;"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c49ddf077fb7c26004c19ad500ea99620e2b857b05d8231487267346fd9da355","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"BK is the rectangle A, BD, for it is contained by GB, BD, and BG is equal to A; and DL is the rectangle A, DE, for DK, that is BG [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)], is equal to A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BK是矩形 A,BD,因为它由GB、BD组成,BG等于A;DL是矩形 A,DE,DK,即BG,等于A。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6544fbb786666a9520492a5d9b651c790c41db2fcc43d5be73b4c834749c0cf6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly also EH is the rectangle A, EC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,矩形 A,EC也是EH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"96491bb25ffebd851333731d1bb9a57c3d0897140252e5d941bd70204cdd23bc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the rectangle A, BC is equal to the rectangle A, BD, the rectangle A, DE and the rectangle A, EC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,矩形 A,BC等于矩形 A,BD,矩形 A,DE和矩形 A,EC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b6f6af07cd9506f3010816c479b173d3d3f759275949f43e92a4b712767e990","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线任以一线任分为若干分其两元线矩内直角形与不分线偕诸分线矩内诸直角形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何由一条直线取出的两条直线都被划分为若干部分：两条直线的矩形和未分割的线段之和等于所有分支的矩形之和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66525172dd1db1a6f55bbd83ec972d3635aaae0c8aba206729f93b3e63201072","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作乙己直角形在乙丙偕等甲之己丙矩线内〈作法于乙界作庚乙丙界作己丙两垂线俱与甲等为平〉〈行次作庚己直线与乙丙平行〉次于丁戊两点作辛丁壬戊两垂线与庚乙己丙平行〈一卷卅三〉其辛丁与庚乙壬戊与己丙既平行则辛丁与壬戊亦平行而辛丁壬戊与己丙等即亦与甲等〈一卷卅四〉如此则乙辛直角形在甲偕乙丁矩线内丁壬直角形在甲偕丁戊矩线内戊己直角形在甲偕戊丙矩线内并之则三矩内直角形与甲偕乙丙两元线矩内直角形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：在 乙丙 和 甲 的 己丙 矩阵中构造矩形 乙己 〈作法于乙界作庚乙丙界作己丙两垂线都与甲等为平〉〈行次作庚己直线与乙丙平行〉 第二至 丁戊。在 辛丁壬戊 点画两条平行于 庚乙己丙 的垂直线。〈一卷卅三〉、辛丁 和 庚乙壬戊 及 己丙 平行，则 辛丁 和 壬戊 也平行于 壬戊，辛丁壬戊 和 己丙 也平行于 甲 和。这样，矩形 乙辛 位于 甲 和 乙丁 矩阵内；丁壬 位于 甲 和 丁戊 矩形内；戊己 平行于 甲 和 戊丙5 弧；如果平行，则三次矩形内的矩形平行于两元素线 甲 和 乙丙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc26d1a978da1f1ab6345c02912b91802641f366b43de0a1c34701ff52528b38","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"注曰：二卷前十题皆言线之能也〈能者谓其上能为直角形也如〉〈十尺线其上能为百尺方形之类〉其说与算数最近故九卷之十四题俱以数明此十题之理今未及详因题意难显略用数明之如本题设两数当两线为六为十以十任三分之为五为三为二六乘十为六十之一大实与六乘五为三十及六乘三为十八六乘二为十二之三小实并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"注意：两卷的前十个问题都讨论了接近算术的线的能力 〈能者谓其上能为矩形也如〉〈十尺线其上能为百尺方形之类〉。因此，第九卷的第十四题用数字说明这十个问题的原理。现在，未 和详细问题难以说明，但用数字和来说明。例如，在本题中，如果两个数字是两条线，六等于十。将十除以三变成三，六乘以十等于六十。大实值等于三十，六乘以三等于十八。六乘以二等于十二。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-1.source","contentId":"euclid-2-1","revisionId":"euclid-2-1@raw-cbc372bed89dc1ea","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75412e539deaede14a039956e66e8cf7e7884212ed2e17c0bcfa41e98afc5aec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-2-1:euclid-1-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-1.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"I. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-1:euclid-1-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-1.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"I. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-1:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-1.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-1:euclid-1-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-1.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-34","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"I. 34"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-2-1:euclid-1-11:explicit","id":"euclid-1-11","book":1,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"过线上一点作直线的垂线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-2-1:euclid-1-3:explicit","id":"euclid-1-3","book":1,"number":3,"kind":"proposition","title":"从长线段截取与短线段相等的部分","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-2-1:euclid-1-31:explicit","id":"euclid-1-31","book":1,"number":31,"kind":"proposition","title":"过已知点作已知直线的平行线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-2-1:euclid-1-34:explicit","id":"euclid-1-34","book":1,"number":34,"kind":"proposition","title":"平行四边形的对边、对角与对角线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-area","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
